# =========================================================
#  BCS Tree-Notebook — Environment variables
# =========================================================

# ---------- LOCAL / OFFLINE (laptop) ----------
# Keep this for the offline laptop mode. Points at the SQLite file
# that lives next to START.bat (db/custom.db).
DATABASE_URL="file:../db/custom.db"

# ---------- CLOUD / VERCEL ----------
# When deploying to Vercel, set these in the Vercel dashboard
# (Project → Settings → Environment Variables) and REMOVE/override the
# sqlite DATABASE_URL above:
#
# 1) DATABASE_URL  = your Neon (Postgres) connection string.
#    e.g. postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-xxxx.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb
#    (Vercel → Storage → Neon → Connect auto-fills this.)
#
# 2) BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN = your Vercel Blob token.
#    (Vercel → Storage → Blob → Connect auto-fills this.)
#
# Optional:
# DB_DEPLOY_ACCEPT_DATA_LOSS=1   # ONLY if a schema change requires data loss
#                                # (normally leave unset — safe default).
